  id: DuelistSignature
  skillName: Grand Riposte
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  skilDesc: "H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng: Ch\u1EC9 khi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t ngay khi b\u1ECB
    \u0111\xE1nh tr\xFAng (gi\u1ED1ng parry) th\xEC m\u1EDBi c\xF3 hi\u1EC7u qu\u1EA3.
    N\u1EBFu k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t sai th\xEC coi nh\u01B0 m\u1EA5t chi\xEAu lu\xF4n.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHi\u1EC7u
    \u1EE9ng: L\xE0m ng\u01B0ng \u0111\u1ECDng th\u1EDDi gian trong 1s, Leonard l\u01B0\u1EDBt
    xuy\xEAn qua k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng m\xECnh, g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    c\u1EF1c l\u1EDBn + V\xF4 hi\u1EC7u h\xF3a v\u0169 kh\xED c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ECBch
    trong 10s (gi\u1EA3m 50% damage c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ECBch)."
